    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13472" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dē-sub</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>praep. c. abl., below, beneath</i> (late
			Lat.; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">desuper): desub Alpibus, id est, desub ipsis
					Italiae faucibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					2, 3, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">desub oculo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Veg. Vet. 2, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">desub rivo, Innocent. de Cas. liter. p. 226 ed.
					Goes.: desub se,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 223</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lucernam desub modio ejecit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Fulg. Mythol. 3, 6</span></i>
			.</div>
